&lt;img src="https://112books.github.io/pocallum.cat/images/obra/arrencant-el-dia.jpg" alt="Arrencant el dia — fotollibre"&gt;
&lt;img src="https://112books.github.io/pocallum.cat/images/obra/preses-falses.jpg" alt="Preses Falses — fotollibre"&gt;
